*SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
VDD 4 0 DC 5V

* PMOS transistor
ML 2 1 4 4 PMOS

* NMOS transistors
MDA 2 2 3 3 NMOS
MDB 3 2 0 0 NMOS
MDC 5 5 3 3 NMOS
MDD 6 6 0 0 NMOS

* Net Definitions
* 1: Gate of ML
* 2: Drain of MDA, Source of ML
* 3: Source of MDA, Drain of MDB
* 4: VDD
* 5: Drain of MDC
* 6: Drain of MDD

* End of SPICE netlist